*$
* LM27402 is High Performance Synchronous Buck Controller with DCR Current Sensing.
* CBOOT , FADJ and SYNC Pin are not modeled.
* Frequency of Oscillator can be changed by passing value to param "PERIOD".
* Note :  To simulate it properly , use simulation settings ABSTOL=1n and ITL4=20. Without these settings, 
* user may face convergence problem depending on the design. 
*
*
